<Defs>

  <!--
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    LUCIFERIUM DECLINE EFFECT POOL
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    Tags:
      luciferium_decline_mild     cycles 1-5
      luciferium_decline_moderate cycles 6-14
      luciferium_decline_severe   cycles 15-26+
    All entries are negative (isPositive=false).
    All entries are player-visible choices - nothing fires silently.
    Labels are imperative ("let the anger out") so they read as
    declarations of what the pawn does. Consequences are shown in the
    hint line beneath.
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  -->

